# Site SEO / GEO (2026)

Use when auditing or improving search and AI-citation visibility for goldenbayorganics.co.nz.
Priority order: **0 → 1 → 3 → 2 → 4 → 5/6/7 → 8**.

## 0. Crawler access

- `public/robots.txt` is generated by `npm run generate:seo` / `scripts/generate-seo.mjs`.
- Must **Allow**: GPTBot, OAI-SearchBot, ChatGPT-User, Google-Extended, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Perplexity-User, Applebot-Extended.
- Bytespider optional (skip unless targeting TikTok/Doubao).
- Hosting is **GitHub Pages** — no Cloudflare Bot Fight Mode on this origin. If DNS/CDN changes, re-check edge bot rules separately from robots.txt.
- GitHub Pages does not expose crawler access logs; measurement of AI bot hits is limited unless a log-capable host/CDN is added.
- No login/paywall. Stocklist **Catalog** is the default SSG view (crawlable). Photos tab is secondary JS UI — keep important facts on Visit / shop / About in static HTML.

## 1. Rendering & indexing

- Build uses **vite-react-ssg** (SSG). Do not move primary copy behind client-only fetches.
- Custom domain `goldenbayorganics.co.nz` with HTTPS (GitHub Pages + `public/CNAME`).
- Every page: `<link rel="canonical">` via `SiteHead` + `pageUrl()`.
- `sitemap.xml` + Sitemap line in robots.txt — regenerated on build with fresh `lastmod`.

## 2. llms.txt

- Publish at `/llms.txt` (generated in `scripts/generate-seo.mjs` — do not hand-edit a generic host default).
- Keep brand one-liner, key page links with blurbs, contact facts, assistant notes.

## 3. Structured data (JSON-LD in SSG head)

- Source of truth: `src/lib/seo.ts` + `SiteHead`.
- Homepage/store: GroceryStore + Organization (logo, legalName, sameAs, GeoCoordinates, OfferCatalog/Service).
- Visit: FAQPage (`visitFaqs`) — each answer standalone.
- `/shop/bulk`: HowTo for refill steps.
- Person: Patricia Smith (`buildPersonJsonLd`) on page graphs.
- SoftwareApplication: N/A for this brochure site.
- Never inject primary LocalBusiness/FAQ schema client-side only.

## 4. Content strategy

- Prefer proprietary stocklist, real shop photos, department copy, and owner/local facts over generic organic-food how-tos.
- Lead sections with a direct 1–2 sentence answer; H1→H2→H3; lists/tables for hours and steps.
- Department bodies live in `src/data/business.ts`. Refresh catalog via stocklist IIF workflow, not hand-edited prices.

## 5. Local business

- Single location: Takaka — one page per department (`/shop/{id}`), not a combined services dump.
- NAP/hours must match Google Business Profile. Set `business.profiles.googleBusinessProfile` when the Maps/GBP URL is known so it appears in `sameAs`.

## 6–8. Off-site / measurement (not code)

- Keep Facebook + GBP name/address/phone consistent with the site.
- Track branded queries and AI citations manually (SGC does not show AI answers); log target prompts periodically.
- Non-search channel already: Facebook; do not depend on one engine alone.
